      <div>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-463337-463346">就眠</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-463346-463364"><rb>前</rb><rt>ぜん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-463364-463372">には</seg></p>
